  {
    "id": 2003004040010,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "se": "0107",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040010"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うわっ！　な、なんだ！？\r\n……め、めぐるか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040020,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あ、ごめんね！　びっくりさせちゃって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040030,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でもすっごく嬉しいことがあったんだ！\r\nそれで、早くプロデューサーに伝えたいなって思って！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040040,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ケンカしてるって話した友だちがいたでしょ？\r\nあの二人が、ちゃんと仲直りできたんだよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040040"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、それは良かったな！",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040050,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！\r\nこれもプロデューサーのおかげだよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや……大したことはしてないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charAnim3": "blank"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040060,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううん！　そんなことないよっ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040070,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーがアドバイスをして\r\nわたしの背中を押してくれたから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040080,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "どうしたらいいか、決められたんだから！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040090,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……多分ね、プロデューサーは\r\nわたしのことをちょっと勘違いしてるんだと思うの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040090"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "勘違い？",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040100,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん。わたしはプロデューサーが思ってるより\r\nずっと臆病で……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040110,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "この間のケンカのことも、\r\n自分だけじゃ踏み出せずにいたと思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040120,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でも、プロデューサーが話を聞いてくれたから\r\n勇気が出たんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040130,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……プロデューサーって不思議だよね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040140,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "いっつも優しくて、話しやすいし\r\n友達みたいに思うこともあるんだけど……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040150,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ、ゴメンね！\r\n悪い意味じゃないんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040150"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、分かってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040160,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしが迷ったり、困ったりしてる時には、\r\nいつも隣にいてくれるの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040170,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そして、勇気が出る言葉をくれる……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040180,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "先生みたいなのに、友達みたいで……\r\nうーん。こういうのって、なんて言ったらいいのかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003004040190,
    "textFrame": "001",
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "とにかく！　わたしにとってプロデューサーは、\r\n特別な存在なんだよ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300404/2003004040190"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "002",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる……",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "charLabel": "meguru"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺はめぐるの\r\nプロデューサーだからな",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "俺にとっても、\r\nめぐるは特別な存在だよ",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
